{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39163","headline":"赠戍兵 · 韦庄","name":"赠戍兵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉皇无事暂游汾，底事狐狸啸作羣。\n夜指碧天占晋分，晓磨孤劒望秦云。\n红旌不卷风长急，画角闲吹日又曛。\n止竟有征须有战，洛阳何用久屯军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}